}],"text":[{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","review_id":"ANbyObPPTPQ-bLg-gUn5ZA","date":"2018-11-26T17:35:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9342537522315979,"text_excerpt":"This is such a cute cafe inside the Roosevelt (Waldorf Astoria) Hotel. I love the desserts here... so creative. My daughter went bananas over the snowman dessert. The food and drink is a little pricey here, but it's awfully convenient, when you are staying there. In the morning, they have pre-made hot, breakfast sandwiches and pastries, but again a little pricey, but super convenient. If you don't want breakfast sandwiches, they have oatmeal and bagels. There is ample seating in the cafe, so bring the fams. Coffee all day long, if you are a coffee fanatic, like me. My favorite time to come here is during the holiday because of the decor and the holiday-themed desserts. Customer service is..."},{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","review_id":"URqy1smUxnt6ongHuRVzkg","date":"2015-02-20T15:15:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9320876598358154,"text_excerpt":"Great little coffee and snack joint inside the Roosevelt Hotel. It's where the gingerbread houses are displayed in December. It has a pretty dessert selection and PJs coffees & teas. Since I'm a fan of PJs teas, this is good for me They can also make a yummy hot chocolate. It's convenient and affordable (especially considering the surroundings). The staff has always been pleasant and patient and the place is clean and beautiful."},{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","review_id":"PkOKwyVV8cdmCQBLehnWcQ","date":"2019-03-25T17:22:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9250400066375732,"text_excerpt":"Above average coffee/pastry shop located near the entrance to the fantastic Roosevelt Hotel. We used Teddy's several times during our 4 night stay at the Roosevelt. Sometimes it was to get a quick breakfast or coffee on our way out of the hotel, other times it was for a snack during the day. The pastries are good, we tried 3 or 4 of them during the stay. The sausage breakfast croissant is a unique item, one that I had not seen before. But, the best thing I ate here was easily the beignets. This was probably a top 3 or 4 thing I ate on the entire trip. They come 3 to an order, and while there is a liberal dusting of powered sugar, there is not as much as you see elsewhere in town. The doug..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","photo_id":"LI0FE_JvxI7-IyfWlh4XBQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LI0FE_JvxI7-IyfWlh4XBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9091404676437378},{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","photo_id":"9yjhyzay372zIIHexBWhPw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9yjhyzay372zIIHexBWhPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8716273307800293},{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","photo_id":"5DVlL7TDlX_bFbUyOcbwQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5DVlL7TDlX_bFbUyOcbwQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8226462006568909},{"business_id":"MCxXobDMaNDCp4lwzUIlNw","photo_id":"LhfsAFjpRioNBXoucsGl7Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LhfsAFjpRioNBXoucsGl7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7910719513893127}]},"notebook_case":null}
